<title>POLAND: Investors bids for PLN 271.1 mln of Polish bonds.</title>
<headline>Investors bids for PLN 271.1 mln of Polish bonds.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investors bid for a total of 271 million zlotys worth of Polish fixed two- and five-year bonds at today's one billion zloty tender, the National Bank of Poland said.</p>
<p>It said investors bid for 195.1 million zlotys of the 15-percent 2-year bonds and 76 million zlotys of the 12-percent 5-year bonds.</p>
<p>Full results should be announced later today.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
